      "caption_text": "New work for @oishii.berry! 🍓⁠\nThis was such a special collab to wrap up AAPI Heritage Month and my first time creating art for a t-shirt (!!) Keep your eye on Oishii's IG tomorrow for something special 👀⁠\n⁠\nThe artwork is inspired by the beauty of nature, the precision of Oishii’s farms, and the quiet feeling of home—something I’ve been thinking about lately. How can we also use tech innovation not to distance ourselves from the organic but become more attuned to it? How do we build the future without abandoning the soul of the natural world.⁠\n⁠\nBringing their berry to life was a full crash course in SSS material settings, cloners, and volume builders. Huge thanks to @iamrejor for his CG wizardry assist helping me get a basic shape down 🙏⁠\n⁠\nIncluded a little bit of BTS and process. I usually create a general pile of objects and then play around with lighting and the set until I find something I like.⁠\n⁠\nCreated with Cinema 4D + Redshift, as always.⁠\n⁠\nCreative Director: @mrozowski⁠\nDesigner: @teoretically⁠\nand the whole Oishii team for having me on this! 🍓⁠",
